---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Start a Small Business Website Project | Brighter Sites"
  description="Start a conversation with Brighter Sites about a custom small-business website, digital presence support, or a free 15-minute website consultation. Treasure Valley businesses and remote clients are welcome."
>
  <section class="page-intro">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Start a project</p>
      <h1>Tell us what you want your website to become.</h1>
      <p class="page-lead">
        Whether you are opening a new business, launching a professional practice,
        or replacing an existing site, the first step is simply a conversation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container contact-panel">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Get in touch</p>
        <h2>Start with a simple introduction.</h2>
        <p>
          Tell us about your business, where you are located or who you serve,
          and what you would like your website or online presence to accomplish.
        </p>
        <p style="margin-top:1rem">
          Brighter Sites works with small businesses broadly and has specialized
          experience with therapists, counselors, coaches, wellness professionals,
          and other trust-based service businesses. We also serve businesses across
          the Treasure Valley, including Meridian, Boise, Eagle, Nampa, Kuna, and Star.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-card" id="consultation">
        <p>Free 15-minute website consultation</p>
        <h3 style="margin-top:.45rem">Talk through your website before you decide.</h3>

        <div style="margin-top:.85rem; color:var(--body); line-height:1.7">
          Not sure what your business needs or whether Brighter Sites is the right fit?
          Request a free 15-minute online consultation to talk through your current
          website, what you are looking for, and any questions about getting started.
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:.8rem; color:var(--body); line-height:1.7">
          Consultations are held online through Google Meet. No phone number is
          required and there is no pressure or obligation.
        </div>

        <a
          class="button"
          href="mailto:help@brightersites.app?subject=Free%2015-Minute%20Website%20Consultation&body=Name%3A%0D%0ABusiness%20or%20practice%20name%3A%0D%0ALocation%20or%20service%20area%3A%0D%0AWebsite%20URL%20(if%20you%20have%20one)%3A%0D%0AWhat%20would%20you%20like%20to%20discuss%3F%3A%0D%0A"
        >
          Request a free 15-minute consultation
        </a>

        <div style="margin:1.6rem 0; border-top:1px solid var(--line)"></div>

        <p>Email</p>
        <a href="mailto:help@brightersites.app">
          help@brightersites.app
        </a>

        <div style="margin-top:1rem; color:var(--body); line-height:1.7">
          Prefer email? Send a short introduction with your business name,
          location or service area, and what you are hoping to improve or build.
          We will reply with the next steps and any questions needed to understand
          the project.
        </div>

        <a class="button secondary" href="mailto:help@brightersites.app">
          Start a conversation
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
